    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n58350" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κοιλότης</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ητος</span>,
			ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>hollowness: a hollow</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῆς γῆς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Mete.</u>
					354a12
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>HA</u>
				529a21
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>Vent.</u>
				30
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κ. ὀρέων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					LXX
					<u>Wi.</u>
					17.19
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κ. ἐν ῥινί,</span>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σιμότης</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Them.
				<u>in Ph.</u>
				42.3
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
