				<u>Ecphr.</u>
				p.157
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				B.
			</span></i> (pl.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			metaph., <i>shortage of cash</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Phld.
				<u>Oec.</u>
				p.71J.
			</span></i></div>
